{"n":102,"name":"At-Takathur","meaning":"Rivalry in Increase","ayahs":8,"startPage":600,"verses":[{"i":1,"ar":"أَلۡهَىٰكُمُ ٱلتَّكَاثُرُ","tr":"Alhakumu alttakathuru","en":"Competition in [worldly] increase diverts you"},{"i":2,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ زُرۡتُمُ ٱلۡمَقَابِرَ","tr":"Hatta zurtumu almaqabira","en":"Until you visit the graveyards"},{"i":3,"ar":"كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","tr":"Kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","en":"No! You are going to know"},{"i":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوۡفَ تَعۡلَمُونَ","tr":"Thumma kalla sawfa taAAlamoona","en":"Then no! You are going to know"},{"i":5,"ar":"كَلَّا لَوۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ عِلۡمَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","tr":"Kalla law taAAlamoona AAilma alyaqeeni","en":"No! If you only knew with knowledge of certainty"},{"i":6,"ar":"لَتَرَوُنَّ ٱلۡجَحِيمَ","tr":"Latarawunna aljaheema","en":"You will surely see the Hellfire"},{"i":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيۡنَ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","tr":"Thumma latarawunnaha AAayna alyaqeeni","en":"Then you will surely see it with the eye of certainty"},{"i":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ يَوۡمَئِذٍ عَنِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","tr":"Thumma latusalunna yawmaithin AAani alnnaAAeemi","en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure"}]}